-- Every check RAISEs on failure, so "Success. No rows returned" at the
-- end means all of them passed. Nothing survives the ROLLBACK, including
-- the throwaway ingest token inserted below.
--
-- The payloads are the parser's real output for the ALP fixtures (the
-- whole Unlawful Eviction chapter and § 27-2029). tests/test_corpus_refresh.py
-- checks they still match what tools/corpus produces, so this file cannot
-- drift from the client silently. The "amended" § 27-2029 is the real
-- section with its overnight rule rewritten to the pre-2017 text.

-- 1. Hash parity with tools/corpus/model.py law_hash() -------------------
DO $$
BEGIN
    ASSERT public.corpus_law_hash(' a ' || chr(9) || chr(10) || chr(11) || chr(12) || chr(13) || ' b ')
         = 'c8687a08aa5d6ed2044328fa6a697ab8e96dc34291e8c2034ae8c38e6fcc6d65', 'ASCII whitespace must collapse exactly as in Python';
    ASSERT public.corpus_law_hash('a' || chr(160) || 'b') = '9507017c6d887511a5a6ac28ea7e3a438882576e1bd76fe3df27a336f49c263b',
        'U+00A0 must NOT be treated as whitespace (Python law_hash keeps it)';
    ASSERT public.corpus_law_hash($heat$a. During the period from October first through May thirty-first, centrally-supplied heat, in any dwelling in which such heat is required to be provided, shall be furnished so as to maintain, in every portion of such dwelling used or occupied for living purposes:
(1) between the hours of six a.m. and ten p.m., a temperature of at least sixty-eight degrees Fahrenheit whenever the outside temperature falls below fifty-five degrees; and
(2) between the hours of ten p.m. and six a.m., a temperature of at least sixty-two degrees Fahrenheit.
b. During the period from October first through May thirty-first, all central heating systems required under this article shall be maintained free of any device which shall cause or which is capable of causing an otherwise operable central heating system to become incapable of providing the minimum requirements of heat or hot water as required by this article for any period of time. This subdivision shall not apply to any safety device required by law, or by a rule or regulation of any city agency, to be used in conjunction with a central heating system.$heat$) = 'cd8f7ddc34282e88fef75e6d3a52b2d6e6bb35643b3b67913b08146919682a83',
        '§ 27-2029 hash must match the client';
END $$;

-- 2. A throwaway token (rolled back with everything else) ---------------
